# 💼 Personal Portfolio Website

A modern and responsive personal portfolio website built with HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5, and Vanilla JavaScript. The website showcases my projects, skills, experience, and contact information through a clean and user-friendly interface.

## 🚀 Live Demo

🔗 https://your-portfolio-link

---

## ✨ Features

- Responsive design
- Dark / Light Mode
- Dynamic projects using JSON
- Project search and filtering
- Project details page
- Contact form validation
- AOS animations
- Mobile-first layout

---

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Bootstrap 5
- JavaScript (ES6)
- JSON
- Fetch API
- LocalStorage
- AOS
- Font Awesome

